<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσό-τονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pulling evenly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).351
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bearing the same accent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Music,
				<i>of level (unvarying) pitch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>; but, <i>in unison</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> generally,
				<i>equal, even</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. τῇ συγκρίσει τοῦ χρώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.123
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>
			<i>equally</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					68.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
